# Create Your Character

Every hero needs a name and a calling. Choose wisely -- your class determines your starting attributes and equipment.

''Enter your name:''
<<textbox "$player_name" "Hero" autofocus>>

---

### Choose Your Class

''Warrior'' -- Strong and resilient. High HP, good with melee weapons.
Starting: +5 Strength, +3 Vitality, Iron Sword
[[Choose Warrior|Warrior Setup]]

''Rogue'' -- Quick and cunning. High agility, stealthy.
Starting: +5 Agility, +3 Intelligence, Dagger, Lockpick
[[Choose Rogue|Rogue Setup]]

''Mage'' -- Knowledgeable in the arcane. High intelligence, magical potential.
Starting: +5 Intelligence, +3 Agility, Staff, Spellbook
[[Choose Mage|Mage Setup]]

